122 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (When a flood is predicted, response teams face a critical question: which locality should get help first with limited resources? Decisions are often made on the spot, slowing response and risking misallocation. The problem is to bridge the gap between flood prediction and actionable response.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
